      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Factories like Inland Steel, Owens‑Illinois Glass, and Ludowici Roofing attracted Italian, Polish, Slovak, Lithuanian, Irish, and Black workers to the East Side and Hill neighborhoods.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3,
        4
